WEBVTT

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:08.520
Mai Kujaku joined Doma and tried to steal Jonouchi's soul.

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:13.660
But when Claw of Hermos appeared, Mai left.

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:17.660
Pegasus's message revealed Doma's identity.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:22.000
To fight this huge enemy, the three chosen by the legendary dragons...

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.730
...Jonouchi, Kaiba and I must work together!

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:48.070
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:55.210
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:55.990 --> 00:01:01.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:07.860
I was searching for your smile

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:15.230
With our memories fading

00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:22.310
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:29.210
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:36.440
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:57.260 --> 00:02:02.900
The Target Is the Nameless Pharaoh

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:11.640
Impossible!  This can't be real!

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:16.580
I feel power coming out of this card!

00:02:16.960 --> 00:02:20.520
The three cards are reacting to each other.

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:30.280
When we acquired these cards, we were destined to defeat Doma.

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:33.130
Destined?  Whatever!

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:36.130
I decide my own road!

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:40.560
Don't talk about fate or destiny to me!

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:43.100
You still talk about that, Kaiba?

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:45.080
They can't be beat alone!

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:47.250
We need your help!

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:50.540
I refuse!  I don't take orders from you!

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:51.530
Kaiba!

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:54.420
I'll defeat Doma alone.

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:57.900
You keep playing your occult games.

00:02:57.900 --> 00:02:59.260
Let's go, Mokuba.

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:01.260
Kaiba!

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:02.890
B-Big brother!

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:06.910
We don't need him.

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:10.570
Since I have Claw of Hermos, Doma can't beat me!

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:14.670
You're finally sounding like yourself, Jonouchi.

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:20.170
Of course!  Thinking won't solve any problems!

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:22.950
Where is it?

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:27.780
How come only they get those powerful cards?  It's not fair!

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:29.500
Keep searching.

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:31.100
They're here somewhere!

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:33.780
What are you doing?

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:38.240
Where are my glasses?

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:39.830
They're right there.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:48.400
What should we do?

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:51.360
Pegasus isn't here.  Where do we go?

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:53.930
To search for Doma!

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:55.550
And get Mai back!

00:03:55.830 --> 00:04:00.850
But we have no leads.  How will we find them?

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:03.060
Well...

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:04.770
Exactly.

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:08.530
It's small, but why don't you come to my apartment for now?

00:04:09.570 --> 00:04:11.730
I know!  Professor Hopkins!

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:15.470
He might've found a lead!

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:21.910
Yeah!  He came back to America to analyze the texts he found in the underwater ruins.

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:27.850
Yes.  I think there's a connection between Doma and the underwater ruins.

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:31.440
If we know where we're going, we just have to get there!

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:47.060
Hey!  Give us a ride!

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:59.680
Sigh...  They're gone.

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:03.160
Don't worry.  I can drive you.

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:05.680
But how many does it fit?

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:11.820
What about us?

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:15.230
Why are you here anyway?

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:24.170
So it's like this, huh?

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:35.210
While they gained strong cards, we got nothing.

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:36.620
Don't give up yet.

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:40.840
Professor Hopkins is a famous card collector.

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:44.660
He must have many unique cards.

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:49.740
If we get rare cards, we'll become stronger!

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:53.660
Speaking of, Mai Kujaku was stronger.

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:54.600
Yeah.

00:05:56.890 --> 00:06:00.180
Hand it over.  Let me look!

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:04.430
Be quiet!  I'm navigating, so leave me alone!

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:07.210
Isn't this way faster?

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.260
That leads to Alaska!

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:13.470
Know which way we're going?

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:16.910
Umm...  Which way again?

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:17.980
Mai...

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:22.160
I chose to fight you.

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:24.120
Say what?

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:25.460
She must be joking!

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:30.500
I want what you got in Battle City!

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:33.530
I want to catch up to you!

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:35.710
I want to defeat you!

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:38.450
It's the only way!

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:40.260
Damn!

00:06:40.260 --> 00:06:42.400
I can't find the right words.

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:46.860
But you're wrong, Mai.  It's not like that.

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:51.680
That's not how we're trying to become true duelists.

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:56.400
My other self...

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:57.600
Partner.

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:59.420
Stay patient!

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:02.400
Yeah, I know.  But...

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:07.120
Mai joined the enemy and took Pegasus's soul.

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:09.840
We've lost too much.

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:13.940
Yeah.  Kaiba won't help us either.

00:07:13.940 --> 00:07:16.510
This will be a tough fight.

00:07:25.890 --> 00:07:27.420
Why did you stop me?

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:33.040
I would've beat Jonouchi if you didn't interfere!

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:36.810
Valon?

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:44.490
Piece of Orichalcos!  Release your power!

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:56.530
That's enough.  It's your fault Valon is hurt.

00:07:56.530 --> 00:08:00.460
It's not my fault!  That's what he gets for interfering in my duel!

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:03.100
Interfere?  You were going to lose.

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:04.900
That's enough, Rafael.

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:08.330
Whatever!  Don't say things you might regret!

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:12.500
What have you been watching?

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:17.240
The legendary dragon card in his deck.

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:21.610
Only a chosen true duelist can acquire it.

00:08:21.610 --> 00:08:23.140
Don't underestimate him.

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:26.080
Jonouchi is a true duelist?

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:30.350
Fine.  I'll show you who the true duelist is!

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:35.280
Hey!  My motorcycle!

00:08:38.050 --> 00:08:41.300
Jonouchi, it won't end like this.

00:08:46.150 --> 00:08:48.800
I'll make up for Mai's failure.

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:50.300
I'll defeat Jonouchi.

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:51.410
Stay patient.

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:53.750
Let's defeat Yugi first.

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:55.340
Fight him already?

00:08:55.340 --> 00:09:01.350
They may have the legendary dragon cards, but we still have the advantage.

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:06.100
If we defeat the Nameless Pharaoh first, the others won't matter.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:08.790
How do we lure Yugi out?

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:13.440
I know where he's going, so I've already made preparations.

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:37.920
Doma...

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:47.920
Whoa!

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:50.900
I bought too much food.

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:54.250
I know it's heavy, but you can make it, Billy!

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:14.280
Visitors?

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:20.660
Grandpa!

00:10:23.610 --> 00:10:25.200
Billy!

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:29.640
Grandpa!

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:50.950
Oh no...

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:54.510
Grandpa!

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:17.950
This is awful.

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:21.390
Professor Hopkins!  Rebecca!

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:22.900
Yugi!

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:26.700
Rebecca!

00:11:27.510 --> 00:11:32.890
Yugi...  My grandpa...

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:43.160
What happened, Rebecca?

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:44.450
Yugi...

00:12:17.430 --> 00:12:20.150
Who did this?

00:12:20.150 --> 00:12:21.570
Doma, of course!

00:12:21.570 --> 00:12:23.370
Who else would?

00:12:23.370 --> 00:12:26.600
Why did they kidnap Professor Hopkins?

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:29.420
It must have to do with the ruins.

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:31.460
Yeah.  I agree.

00:12:33.660 --> 00:12:35.940
Rebecca, what about that piece?

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:36.890
Huh?

00:12:36.890 --> 00:12:40.720
The crystal-like piece I gave the Professor.

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:42.760
Oh.  Don't worry.

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:45.790
Grandpa told me to hold onto it.

00:12:46.060 --> 00:12:48.940
We still don't know anything about it.

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:55.320
What do we do now?

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:59.040
This is a crime!

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:00.750
We'll call the police!

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:04.580
No!  They'll hurt my grandpa!

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:05.690
Rebecca...

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:10.860
We can only wait and see what they do next.

00:13:10.860 --> 00:13:13.870
Damn!  We have to wait?

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:15.740
I guess so.

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:17.900
Then let's eat.

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:20.410
We haven't eaten today.

00:13:20.410 --> 00:13:23.300
Yeah.  Rebecca, can I use your kitchen?

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:24.750
I'll help.

00:13:25.230 --> 00:13:29.050
Don't worry.  Professor Hopkins will be back safe and sound.

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:37.760
Honda!  Set the table!

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:40.500
There aren't enough plates.

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:43.200
Jonouchi, what are you doing?

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:46.900
You punk!

00:13:47.390 --> 00:13:49.740
Where's Haga and Ryuzaki?

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:53.670
Yugi and Rebecca are missing, too.

00:14:00.180 --> 00:14:01.630
Where can they be?

00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:16.800
Stop playing around and search!

00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:19.800
There's no way they're here!

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:22.110
And if they were, they're burned up!

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:23.240
You're right.

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:25.940
I want to eat takoyaki.

00:14:25.940 --> 00:14:28.010
I don't like spaghetti.

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:29.680
I want to eat sushi.

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:38.230
What did you want to talk about?

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:41.920
Yugi, please save my grandpa!

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:44.960
Of course.  We'll save the Professor.

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:47.590
That's not what I mean.

00:14:49.260 --> 00:14:50.400
What's this?

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:53.900
I kept it secret because I didn't know what to say.

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:58.380
Nameless Pharaoh, I'll be at Death Valley at sunrise.

00:14:58.380 --> 00:15:00.080
Come alone.

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:02.900
Rafael of Doma's Three Musketeers.

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:06.430
Rebecca, where's Death Valley?

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:11.400
Straight ahead.  About an hour drive.

00:15:12.770 --> 00:15:14.750
Sorry, Rebecca.

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:19.130
I'm sorry to drag you into my fight.

00:15:20.510 --> 00:15:24.360
But I can't let you go alone.

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:25.920
I'll be fine.

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:29.190
I promise to save Professor Hopkins.

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:32.520
But don't tell anyone.

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:33.510
Yugi...

00:15:45.220 --> 00:15:48.760
Are you awake, Professor Hopkins?

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:50.820
Who are you?

00:15:51.770 --> 00:15:54.760
I'm Rafael, one of Doma's Three Musketeers.

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:59.700
Doma?  The same Doma in the engravings?

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:06.220
There's a connection between you and the underwater ruins.

00:16:06.220 --> 00:16:09.580
And with Yugi-  I mean, the Nameless Pharaoh.

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:13.800
Professor, you should stay away from us.

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:17.520
That's why we burned down your lab.

00:16:17.520 --> 00:16:25.460
Even if I'm gone, the research on the ruins will continue as long as it exists.

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:27.130
That won't happen.

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:29.290
What do you mean?

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:30.060
Who knows.

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:34.730
But don't worry.  You're free to go.

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:37.440
Our preparations are complete.

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:46.620
I'll never forgive Doma!

00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:55.050
Yugi...

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:59.220
Don't worry.  I'm going.

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:02.420
Yugi...

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:21.040
Rafael...

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:27.860
Just wait!  I will defeat you!

00:18:48.130 --> 00:18:49.860
Huh?  Yugi?

00:18:55.560 --> 00:18:58.850
You idiot!  Why didn't you say anything?

00:19:00.310 --> 00:19:02.450
She had no choice, Jonouchi.

00:19:02.450 --> 00:19:04.680
What would you do in her shoes?

00:19:05.190 --> 00:19:08.130
We should've called the police.

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:09.200
Damn!

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:12.030
Jonouchi!

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:20.400
What is it, Jonouchi?

00:19:24.020 --> 00:19:25.940
Professor Hopkins!

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:28.370
Grandpa!

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:31.810
Professor!

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:33.240
Grandpa!

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:38.120
Rebecca, where's Yugi?

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:48.710
My other self.

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:50.300
Partner.

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:53.970
They made one mistake.

00:19:54.530 --> 00:19:56.330
You noticed too?

00:19:56.560 --> 00:20:00.970
Of course!  We can never be apart!

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:02.070
Yeah.

00:20:10.130 --> 00:20:12.380
Anzu, leave Yugi to us.

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:14.710
Take care of the Professor and Rebecca.

00:20:14.710 --> 00:20:17.070
Okay.  Find Yugi!

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:18.830
Trust us.

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:25.880
By the way, where's Haga and Ryuzaki?

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:31.660
We have to see Yugi and Doma's battle!

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:35.440
And find out how Mai became so strong!

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:39.020
I know!  That's why we gotta get there before him-

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:46.580
He passed us!  Damn!

00:21:00.310 --> 00:21:01.700
Yugi...

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:09.520
We're coming, Yugi.

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:35.770
Nameless Pharaoh, we will defeat you.

00:21:59.010 --> 00:22:07.920
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:08.420 --> 00:22:16.260
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:17.990 --> 00:22:27.420
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:28.030 --> 00:22:36.940
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:37.510 --> 00:22:45.970
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:46.750 --> 00:22:51.480
I'll live feeling them

00:22:52.090 --> 00:22:56.660
For me to be me

00:22:56.660 --> 00:23:05.120
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:05.800 --> 00:23:10.760
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:20.420
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:27.510 --> 00:23:32.310
Due to Doma's schemes, Yugi heads alone to Rafael at Death Valley.

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:34.120
Please be careful!

00:23:34.120 --> 00:23:39.640
Professor Hopkins is back safely, but we don't know what other traps await!

00:23:39.640 --> 00:23:44.090
Rafael is so calm that he's dangerous!

00:23:44.090 --> 00:23:47.220
What kind of deck will he duel with?

00:23:47.220 --> 00:23:51.620
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Yugi vs Rafael
Impenetrable Guardian Deck

00:23:51.620 --> 00:23:53.190
Duel, standby!
